      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b7x",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1207704526,
      "version": 315,
      "versionNonce": 1155503566,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791301975403,
      "created": 1791301886234,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- Classic flow: User → Backend → DB → Backend → User\n- With Redis, Backend checks Redis first for every request.\n- Cache HIT: Data exists in Redis → Redis → Backend → User\n- Cache MISS: Data not in Redis → Backend → DB → Backend\n- After getting data from DB, Backend stores it in Redis for future requests.\n- Next frequent request can be served directly from Redis, avoiding the DB.\n- DB = Source of Truth; Redis = Fast Cache.\n- Blue box = Network latency between Backend ↔ Redis/DB.\n- Redis reduces DB load and response latency, especially for frequently requested data.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "right",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- Classic flow: User → Backend → DB → Backend → User\n- With Redis, Backend checks Redis first for every request.\n- Cache HIT: Data exists in Redis → Redis → Backend → User\n- Cache MISS: Data not in Redis → Backend → DB → Backend\n- After getting data from DB, Backend stores it in Redis for future requests.\n- Next frequent request can be served directly from Redis, avoiding the DB.\n- DB = Source of Truth; Redis = Fast Cache.\n- Blue box = Network latency between Backend ↔ Redis/DB.\n- Redis reduces DB load and response latency, especially for frequently requested data.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
